# (R46, R22, R21, R23, R24, R25, R34), then ruff, pytest and Adrian's command files against facit.
# Finds how far the project already is (after 1.0.14 ... 1.0.21) and continues from there.
# Everything is done in memory first; files are written only if every step goes through.
# Changed files are backed up to %TEMP% first. Run from the project folder with .venv active:
#   powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\spektro-1.0.15-1.0.21.ps1
param([string]$Rot = (Get-Location).Path)
